     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The <i>n</i>th term of a geometric sequence, <span data-math=\"{a_n}\"></span>, with first term <span data-math=\"{a_1}\"></span> and common ratio <i>r</i>, is <span data-math=\"{a_n} = {a_1}{r^{n - 1}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{a_5} = 0.5{\\left( 8 \\right)^4} = 2,048\"></span></p>"
